


 Minutes of the FIGGY BAR RT Conference.

Date: 05/31/90   Time: 22:34EDT

  The question of the night: "Did you use Forth today ? This week ? Another
                              OS or language ? Comments..."
  Other items discussed: Mike Ham's Easter date, the BASIS, X3/J14 (esp. the
  adoption of Bradley's CATCH/THROW instead of Morgenstern's NETS), Pygmy.
                      
Attendees:
[GARY-S]
[[Len] NMORGENSTERN]
[[Kevin] APPERT]
[Wil] W.BADEN1]
[[Dave] OLORIN]
[[ANSI-jax] JAX]
[[Dennis] D.RUFFER]

